"Kibby, properly Kivb-ee, is an Artonan girl who has lived her whole life on Moon Thegund."
"She is about eight by human standards, with dark brown eyes and short brown hair."
"Her father was one of Joe's scientists and studied the demon bugs."
"Her father and little sister Wivb-ee died in an overturned armored car in the chaos outbreak."
"Alden Thorn found her blowing his gift whistle beside them and carried her, preserved, to Joe's lab."
"She is a weak, ungifted wizard; Joe advised against formal training for her as a toddler."
"She refused calculus until allowed magic; Joe gave her eight lessons and Gwen-lor's recordings."
"She has power that won't move for her, can rarely cast a spell, and does advanced math at seven."
"She is bossy, friendly-mean and very serious about teachers."
"She tutored Alden in Artonan and wizard basics, and he calls her Instructor Kivb-ee."
"She calls Joe Distinguished Master Ro-den."
"She dreams of being a knight and of boarding at Instructor Gwen-lor's school."
"On Day 152 she spotted the first sign of rescue on the chaos map."
"She gave Alden twelve drops of her blood so he might share Gorgon's stabilizing gift."
"Alden promised her they will get contract tattoos together when she is older."
"She gave Alden her auriad, which Joe had hidden for her inside her lesson cushion."
"On Day 186 she armed Joe's bomb and blew up his lab, cursing the Yipalck Corporation."
"Knight Alis-art'h's team rescued her and Alden, and Rrorro healed her corrupted hands."
"She is to live with a cousin on Artona I and later attend a wizard boarding school."
"She declares she will be the next Primary."
"After Alden left she stayed with Alis-art'h's ground team, and he keeps her a priority contact."
"From Alis-art'h's ship she sends Alden long-titled messages and asked to see his cat."
